# Release signing material and store-upload credentials (never commit).
# .secrets/ holds the live upload key and the offsite-backup drop folders.
# Back up pos-go-release.jks + credentials.txt into .secrets/play/offsite/ and
# copy that folder somewhere durable and private — nothing under .secrets/ is
# ever tracked, by design: a lost upload key is unrecoverable once Play App
# Signing is enrolled except through Google's key-reset request.
.secrets/
Flutter/pos_go_app/android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
